of methods and explicitly identify any remaining gaps.\n\nCoordination protocol: The coordinator assesses each exact mandatory report and saves a complete next-round prompt before authorizing further work. Only Round 1 is presently authorized. No capacity-driven splitting. Each leaf should produce concise but mathematically complete structured reports, approximately 700 words when feasible, with rigorous evidence, explicit obstacles, and accurate status. All internal work must be in English. No external data, software execution, or unsupported claims of independent verification.",
